BT 1 0 0 1 0 243.1 Tm 3.148126 Tw 10.5 TL /F3 8.9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Abstract\227) Tj /F2 8.9 Tf ( Document images acquired from scanners, cameras,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.58778 Tw (photocopiers, and historical archives may contain additive noise,) Tj T* 0 Tw 6.605776 Tw (impulse corruption, blur, periodic interference, fading, and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.495622 Tw (background degradation. These defects reduce visual legibility and) Tj T* 0 Tw .065595 Tw (can impair optical character recognition \(OCR\). This paper presents a) Tj T* 0 Tw 10.64855 Tw (controlled comparative framework for evaluating three) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.019831 Tw (spatial-domain filters\227mean, Gaussian, and median\227and three) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.940791 Tw (FFT-based low-pass filters\227ideal, Butterworth, and Gaussian\227on) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.822782 Tw (degraded document images. The research question is how these) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.52661 Tw (filtering families compare under different degradation conditions.) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.63922 Tw (The paper formalizes the six operators, describes a reproducible) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.846537 Tw (corruption and restoration protocol, and specifies evaluation using) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.719351 Tw (mean squared error \(MSE\), peak signal-to-noise ratio \(PSNR\),) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.08418 Tw (structural similarity \(SSIM\), OCR accuracy, and processing time. The) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.812208 Tw (project presentation defines the intended workflow and qualitative) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.18407 Tw (expectations but does not provide dataset details, parameter values,) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.334793 Tw (restored-image measurements, OCR outputs, or timing results.) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.391132 Tw (Accordingly, no numerical performance claim is presented as an) Tj T* 0 Tw 5.81961 Tw (experimental finding. The comparative analysis is explicitly) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.507022 Tw (preliminary and identifies testable expectations and a reporting) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.018445 Tw (protocol for subsequent measurement. The central premise is that) Tj T* 0 Tw .397108 Tw (smoothing may suppress noise while also attenuating high-frequency) Tj T* 0 Tw .380845 Tw (character strokes; visual smoothness alone is therefore insufficient to) Tj T* 0 Tw (establish successful document restoration.) Tj T* ET
