BT 1 0 0 1 0 110.75 Tm /F2 9.15 Tf 10.9 TL .469757 Tw (Document image restoration is a preprocessing activity intended to) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.663622 Tw (improve an observed image while retaining information required) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.264663 Tw (for interpretation. It is closely related to enhancement, denoising,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.431543 Tw (deblurring, binarization, and background normalization, but these) Tj T* 0 Tw .248143 Tw (operations are not interchangeable. Denoising suppresses unwanted) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.67527 Tw (fluctuations; deblurring attempts to reverse loss of spatial detail;) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.441893 Tw (binarization separates foreground text from background; and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.586057 Tw (geometric correction addresses skew or page curvature. A single) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.750195 Tw (filter rarely solves all of these problems. The present study) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.156396 Tw (therefore narrows its scope to a comparison of six low-pass or) Tj T* 0 Tw (smoothing filters under four controlled degradation classes.) Tj T* ET
