BT 1 0 0 1 0 99.85 Tm /F2 9.15 Tf 10.9 TL 1.238012 Tw (The requirements of document images differ from those of many) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.068229 Tw (natural photographs. A page may consist of large, nearly uniform) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.760218 Tw (background regions interrupted by thin, high-contrast strokes.) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.993232 Tw (Small changes in stroke width, connectivity, or punctuation can) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.552562 Tw (change a character's identity. A method that creates a visually) Tj T* 0 Tw .060784 Tw (smooth background may erase a dot, close the counter of a letter, or) Tj T* 0 Tw .029413 Tw (merge two adjacent characters. Conversely, a method that preserves) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.66347 Tw (every edge may retain noise that interferes with segmentation.) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.833018 Tw (Restoration must balance background cleanliness and character) Tj T* 0 Tw (integrity.) Tj T* ET
