BT 1 0 0 1 0 99.85 Tm /F2 9.15 Tf 10.9 TL 4.269568 Tw (Document degradation may arise during acquisition, storage,) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.351918 Tw (transmission, or physical ageing. Acquisition defects include) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.370822 Tw (defocus, motion blur, scanner streaks, illumination gradients, and) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.443951 Tw (sensor noise. Repeated photocopying can reduce contrast and) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.624337 Tw (introduce speckle. Historical pages may contain stains, paper) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.323412 Tw (texture, faded ink, show-through from the reverse side, and local) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.060271 Tw (ink spread. Compression can create block or ringing artifacts. These) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.840015 Tw (mechanisms differ in spatial extent and statistical properties;) Tj T* 0 Tw .529395 Tw (consequently, a filter suited to isolated impulse noise may perform) Tj T* 0 Tw (poorly on blur or slowly varying background illumination.) Tj T* ET
