BT 1 0 0 1 0 88.95 Tm /F2 9.15 Tf 10.9 TL .150179 Tw (A practical restoration system must also account for the document's) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.932795 Tw (content. Text is not a generic texture: stroke width, character) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.772115 Tw (spacing, line structure, and punctuation encode information. The) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.164987 Tw (loss of a single pixel may be unimportant in a photograph but) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.006664 Tw (significant when it removes a small diacritic. This motivates the use) Tj T* 0 Tw .828358 Tw (of OCR accuracy alongside conventional image-quality metrics. It) Tj T* 0 Tw .391129 Tw (also motivates a paired experimental design in which each restored) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.155481 Tw (output is compared with the exact clean source from which its) Tj T* 0 Tw (degraded input was generated.) Tj T* ET
