BT 1 0 0 1 0 99.85 Tm /F2 9.15 Tf 10.9 TL 1.743731 Tw (For a 3\3273 kernel, every coefficient is 1/9. The operator reduces) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.138001 Tw (local variation by distributing the influence of each pixel over its) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.774051 Tw (neighbours. It is simple and often efficient, especially when) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.296244 Tw (implemented with a separable or running-sum method. Under) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.215793 Tw (approximately zero-mean additive noise, averaging can reduce) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.269657 Tw (variance in locally uniform areas. However, it replaces sharp) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.420213 Tw (transitions with intermediate intensities. On a document, this can) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.136563 Tw (soften thin strokes, close small gaps, reduce punctuation contrast,) Tj T* 0 Tw 5.588693 Tw (and merge adjacent characters. Larger windows strengthen) Tj T* 0 Tw (smoothing but increase detail loss.) Tj T* ET
